                <mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 255);&quot;&gt;SMART ASSIST - High Level Logical View&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#0000FF;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="980" y="170" width="500" height="26" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="21" value="&lt;ol style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); font-size: 15px; text-align: left; white-space: nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); background-color: transparent; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);&quot;&gt;ICRM Business User sends a natural-language request via the Smart Assist Chat UI.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;MCA / Regulation / CIA sources feed data and documents (batch) into Data/ETL.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(63, 63, 63);&quot;&gt;ETL loads a Postgres staging snapshot, generates embeddings and persists them to pgVector (RAG store).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;Front End forwards the request to the Agentic Orchestration (ICRM Director-Agent).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;Director-Agent plans the task and orchestrates the Tools Layer (RAG / MCP / Local).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;RAG Tool runs Vector Embedding / Search against pgVector to retrieve process &amp;amp; control context.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;Agent calls the LLM through R2D2 (LLM Proxy); R2D2 makes a token-validated call to Gemini 2.5 Pro.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;Function &amp;amp; Tool Execution issues an MCP envelope to the MCP Servers (CIA / Reg Mgmt / MCA Proxy).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;MCP Servers call the internal Citi systems over REST (CIA, REG Mgmt, MCA each with its DB).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;MCA / CIA MCP path also reaches CIA External Interfaces (iDOC, EEMS) for documents &amp;amp; entitlements.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;Retrieved data is validated (exception &amp;amp; compliance checks) and passed to Response Synthesis.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;Synthesised answer returns to the Front End and is delivered to the UI.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;The Cross-cutting Governance Plane (Entitlements · Audit · Provenance · COIN-Auth) governs every agent action.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;All components emit logs / traces to Logger Storage (ELK) for observability &amp;amp; audit.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="2310" y="230" width="800" height="470" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="22" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 102, 102);&quot;&gt;Notes&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;html=1;fontSize=24;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="2620" y="240" width="100" height="40" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
        </mxGraphModel>
    </diagram>
</mxfile>